  "todaysAffirmationLabel": "Today's affirmation",
  "thereFallback": "there",
  "dailyAffirmation1": "The real miracle is believing in yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation2": "Diversity makes the world beautiful.",
  "dailyAffirmation3": "After the rain comes the rainbow.",
  "dailyAffirmation4": "Allow yourself to be authentic, even in places where everyone is expected to be the same.",
  "dailyAffirmation5": "Your worth is not what you have, but who you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation6": "It's ok not to be ok.",
  "dailyAffirmation7": "There is a seat waiting for you at tables you haven't even seen.",
  "dailyAffirmation8": "You can do anything but you don't have to.",
  "dailyAffirmation9": "If saying goodbye hurts, it means you spent your time well.",
  "dailyAffirmation10": "Remember who cares about you.",
  "dailyAffirmation11": "What if it turns out better than you imagined?",
  "dailyAffirmation12": "You are enough",
  "dailyAffirmation13": "I make my own path",
  "dailyAffirmation14": "Today is a new day. Shine!",
  "dailyAffirmation15": "Never lose hope. Storms make people stronger and never last forever.",
  "dailyAffirmation16": "Cry. Forgive. Learn. Move on. Let your tears water the seeds of your future happiness.",
  "dailyAffirmation17": "It might not be easy but it'll be worth it.",
  "dailyAffirmation18": "Don't forget to focus on the good things.",
  "dailyAffirmation19": "It's not selfish, it's self care.",
  "dailyAffirmation20": "You are the best, keep going.",
  "dailyAffirmation21": "Believe in yourself. You can make miracles happen",
  "dailyAffirmation22": "With the flow of life, this too shall pass.",
  "dailyAffirmation23": "Every challenge I face is an opportunity to grow stronger.",
  "dailyAffirmation24": "I embrace the questions in my heart and welcome the answers in their own time.",
  "dailyAffirmation25": "You don't have to be perfect.",
  "dailyAffirmation26": "Perfection is a utopia. It only serves as a compass.",
  "dailyAffirmation27": "I stand and fight to find my dreams.",
  "dailyAffirmation28": "Don't let the other decide your future.",
  "dailyAffirmation29": "I am grounded, resilient and open to grow even in uncertain times.",
  "dailyAffirmation30": "If life gives you moments, make them good memories.",
  "dailyAffirmation31": "Old ways won't open new doors.",
  "dailyAffirmation32": "Mistakes are proof that you are trying.",
  "dailyAffirmation33": "Just take that step and try, it's enough.",
  "dailyAffirmation34": "Just look at what we can do when we come together.",
  "dailyAffirmation35": "When you don't know where you are going, all roads will get you there.",
  "dailyAffirmation36": "Life is one day and that is today.",
  "dailyAffirmation37": "We are all made of stardust.",
  "dailyAffirmation38": "Dream with passion, live with responsibility.",
  "dailyAffirmation39": "It's all going to be okay. Say it one more time.",
  "dailyAffirmation40": "Be weird, be unique, be yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation41": "Strong minds grow in safe spaces.",
  "dailyAffirmation42": "Every beginning is only a sequel, after all, and the book of events is always open halfway through.",
  "dailyAffirmation43": "Everything has a beginning and an ending, and the end can be beautiful, no matter how dark it seems now.",
  "dailyAffirmation44": "The only approval I will ever need is mine.",
  "dailyAffirmation45": "We shouldn't be looking for heroes, we should be looking for good ideas.",
  "dailyAffirmation46": "The smallest good deed is far better than the biggest good intention.",
  "dailyAffirmation47": "Where you come from is not something to shrink — it's something to stand inside of.",
  "dailyAffirmation48": "Your name, your language, your family's story, these are yours to carry with pride.",
  "dailyAffirmation49": "You don't need permission to take up space in this world.",
  "dailyAffirmation50": "You are not \"too much\" of anything. You are exactly the right amount of you.",
  "dailyAffirmation51": "Your roots don't hold you back, they're what let you grow tall.",
  "dailyAffirmation52": "There's no single way to belong somewhere. You get to write your own way.",
  "dailyAffirmation53": "Your story matters, even the parts nobody's asked about yet.",
  "dailyAffirmation54": "You carry more than one home inside you, and that's not a burden, it's a richness.",
  "dailyAffirmation55": "Being proud of who you are doesn't need anyone else's approval first.",
  "dailyAffirmation56": "You don't have to earn your place here. You already have one.",
  "dailyAffirmation57": "Somewhere, a door is open for you, even on days it doesn't feel like it.",
  "dailyAffirmation58": "You are allowed to build a home in more than one place.",
  "dailyAffirmation59": "The people who matter will make room for you, not ask you to shrink.",
  "dailyAffirmation60": "You are not a guest in your own life.",
  "dailyAffirmation61": "Wherever you stand today, you have every right to be standing there.",
  "dailyAffirmation62": "Community isn't something you wait for, sometimes you're the one who starts it.",
  "dailyAffirmation63": "You don't have to choose between where you're from and where you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation64": "Today doesn't have to look like tomorrow.",
  "dailyAffirmation65": "Somewhere ahead, there's a version of your life you haven't imagined yet, and it's a good one.",
  "dailyAffirmation66": "Hard chapters end. Yours will too.",
  "dailyAffirmation67": "You're allowed to want more for yourself, and to go get it.",
  "dailyAffirmation68": "The future isn't fixed. You still get a say in it.",
  "dailyAffirmation69": "Small steps still count as moving forward.",
  "dailyAffirmation70": "You are not behind. You are exactly where your path has taken you.",
  "dailyAffirmation71": "What's coming for you hasn't happened yet, leave room for it to surprise you.",
  "dailyAffirmation72": "You get to decide what your story looks like from here.",
  "dailyAffirmation73": "You've made it through every hard day so far. That's not luck, that's you.",
  "dailyAffirmation74": "Being tired doesn't mean you're failing. It means you've been carrying a lot.",
  "dailyAffirmation75": "You don't have to be unbreakable. You just have to keep going at your own pace.",
  "dailyAffirmation76": "Strength isn't never struggling, it's showing up again anyway.",
  "dailyAffirmation77": "You're allowed to be proud of getting through, even if it wasn't pretty.",
  "dailyAffirmation78": "The hardest parts of your story don't get the final word.",
  "dailyAffirmation79": "You've survived things people never see, and that counts for something.",
  "dailyAffirmation80": "It's okay if healing takes longer than you expected.",
  "dailyAffirmation81": "You don't need to have it all figured out to keep moving.",
  "dailyAffirmation82": "Every day you keep showing up is a quiet kind of courage.",
  "dailyAffirmation83": "You are legally allowed to have a mediocre day. No permit needed.",
  "dailyAffirmation84": "Sometimes life is just deciding what to eat, three times a day, forever. You've got this.",
  "dailyAffirmation85": "Not every day has to be a masterpiece. Some days just have to happen.",
  "dailyAffirmation86": "You're doing better than your group chat notifications suggest.",
  "dailyAffirmation87": "Confidence is just pretending you know where you're going until you actually do.",
  "dailyAffirmation88": "You've survived 100% of your worst days. Solid track record.",
  "dailyAffirmation89": "Nobody has it all figured out. The ones who look like they do are just better at texting back slowly.",
  "dailyAffirmation90": "You don't need a five-year plan today. A decent breakfast will do.",
  "dailyAffirmation91": "Growth looks a lot like tripping forward and calling it progress.",
  "dailyAffirmation92": "Some days the win is just: you got up. That counts.",
  "dailyAffirmation93": "You don't have to carry everything alone, let people help.",
  "dailyAffirmation94": "Somebody out there has your back, even on days it's hard to feel it.",
  "dailyAffirmation95": "Asking for help is not a weakness. It's how people build real friendships.",
  "dailyAffirmation96": "The people around you need you exactly as much as you need them.",
  "dailyAffirmation97": "You are part of something bigger, even on the days you feel invisible.",
  "dailyAffirmation98": "You're allowed to rest before you're completely exhausted.",
  "dailyAffirmation99": "Feeling sad today doesn't cancel out feeling okay tomorrow.",
  "dailyAffirmation100": "You don't owe anyone constant positivity.",
  "dailyAffirmation101": "It's fine to not have an answer right now.",
  "dailyAffirmation102": "Taking care of yourself today is not selfish, it's necessary.",
  "dailyAffirmation103": "Someone else's prejudice is not evidence about who you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation104": "You are not the story other people tell about you.",
  "dailyAffirmation105": "Believing you deserve less is never true. You deserve full respect.",
  "dailyAffirmation106": "Your worth is never up for debate, no matter who makes you feel otherwise.",
  "dailyAffirmation107": "You are not invisible. Someone here sees exactly who you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation108": "Being overlooked by some doesn't mean you go unseen by all.",
  "dailyAffirmation109": "You matter, even in rooms where no one says so out loud.",
  "dailyAffirmation110": "Someone noticed. You are not as unseen as it feels.",
  "dailyAffirmation111": "You don't have to shrink to be noticed for the right reasons.",
  "dailyAffirmation112": "Being seen starts with how you see yourself, and you're allowed to start there.",
  "dailyAffirmation113": "You are not \"too much\" or \"not enough\", you are simply seen.",
  "dailyAffirmation114": "There are people who value exactly what makes you, you.",
  "dailyAffirmation115": "Your presence changes a room, even when it feels like it doesn't.",
  "dailyAffirmation116": "You are known by more people, in more ways, than you realize.",
  "dailyAffirmation117": "You don't control everything that happens to you. You do control how you meet it.",
  "dailyAffirmation118": "You get to be the one who decides what happens next for you.",
  "dailyAffirmation119": "Small choices are still yours to make, even in hard circumstances.",
  "dailyAffirmation120": "You are not a passenger in your own life.",
  "dailyAffirmation121": "Asking for what you need is a form of power, not weakness.",
  "dailyAffirmation122": "You have a say in this, even when it doesn't feel like it.",
  "dailyAffirmation123": "Nobody gets to write your next chapter but you.",
  "dailyAffirmation124": "Even in systems that weren't built for you, your choices still count.",
  "dailyAffirmation125": "You are allowed to want things to be different, and to work toward that.",
  "dailyAffirmation126": "What you do with today is still yours to decide.",
  "dailyAffirmation127": "You don't need to change who you are to have earned your place here.",
  "dailyAffirmation128": "There are people who will hold space for exactly who you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation129": "You belong to more than one place, and that's not a contradiction.",
  "dailyAffirmation130": "Real connection doesn't ask you to hide any part of yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation131": "Somewhere, someone is glad you exist.",
  "dailyAffirmation132": "You don't have to explain yourself to belong.",
  "dailyAffirmation133": "Community isn't something you have to qualify for. You're already in it.",
  "dailyAffirmation134": "Being far from where you started doesn't mean you're without a home.",
  "dailyAffirmation135": "You don't have to do this alone, even when it feels that way.",
  "dailyAffirmation136": "There are people building a life alongside you, not just watching from outside.",
  "dailyAffirmation137": "Your roots carry generations of strength, you inherited that, too.",
  "dailyAffirmation138": "Your language, your traditions, your family's story, they are worth keeping alive.",
  "dailyAffirmation139": "What makes your community different is exactly what makes it worth being part of.",
  "dailyAffirmation140": "You don't owe anyone an apology for where you come from.",
  "dailyAffirmation141": "Your heritage is not something to manage. It's something to be proud of.",
  "dailyAffirmation142": "Your culture is not a problem to solve. It's part of your strength.",
  "dailyAffirmation143": "Being proud of who you are is not the same as being naive about the world.",
  "dailyAffirmation144": "Your identity is not a burden you carry. It's a foundation you stand on.",
  "dailyAffirmation145": "What was passed down to you deserves to be passed forward.",
  "dailyAffirmation146": "It's okay if today feels blank. You don't have to perform being fine.",
  "dailyAffirmation147": "You're allowed to be tired of explaining yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation148": "Sadness doesn't mean you're weak. It means you're paying attention to something real.",
  "dailyAffirmation149": "You don't have to have hope every single day. Some days, just getting through is enough.",
  "dailyAffirmation150": "It's okay to be angry about things that were never fair.",
  "dailyAffirmation151": "Crying about something real is not the same as falling apart.",
  "dailyAffirmation152": "You don't need to justify why something hurt. It did. That's enough reason.",
  "dailyAffirmation153": "Some days the bar is \"got dressed.\" Respect the bar.",
  "dailyAffirmation154": "You've made it through 100% of your Mondays. Undefeated.",
  "dailyAffirmation155": "Nobody's life is actually like their photos. Yours doesn't need to be either.",
  "dailyAffirmation156": "Being an adult is 10% wisdom, 90% pretending you know how the printer works.",
  "dailyAffirmation157": "You are one snack away from feeling like a slightly better person. Go get it.",
  "dailyAffirmation158": "Confidence is just walking into a room like you paid rent there.",
  "dailyAffirmation159": "It's fine to nap through your feelings sometimes. Feelings are patient.",
  "dailyAffirmation160": "You don't have to be a \"morning person.\" You just have to survive the morning.",
  "dailyAffirmation161": "Overthinking burns calories too, probably. You've earned dessert.",
  "dailyAffirmation162": "Some decisions are best made by flipping a coin and being relieved either way.",
  "dailyAffirmation163": "You are doing great, statistically speaking, compared to a raccoon in a bin.",
  "dailyAffirmation164": "Deep breaths count as a whole wellness routine. You're basically thriving.",
  "dailyAffirmation165": "If today were a group project, you'd have done more than half the people.",
  "dailyAffirmation166": "Nobody's plants survive the first try. You're doing better than you think.",
  "dailyAffirmation167": "You've technically survived every single \"worst day ever\" so far.",
  "dailyAffirmation168": "Being tired is just your body applauding you for existing all day.",
  "dailyAffirmation169": "Not every day needs a plot twist. Some days just need snacks and a nap.",
  "dailyAffirmation170": "You are allowed to be a work in progress and still be a whole person today.",
  "dailyAffirmation171": "Procrastinating on something scary is just your brain being a good friend.",
  "dailyAffirmation172": "Life doesn't come with instructions, so honestly, you're improvising beautifully.",
  "dailyAffirmation173": "You are the main character today, even if the plot is just laundry.",
  "dailyAffirmation174": "It's okay to not have your life together. Nobody's is, they just have better lighting.",
  "dailyAffirmation175": "You've navigated today without a manual, which is basically a superpower.",
  "dailyAffirmation176": "Small wins still count, even ones like \"answered that one message.\"",
  "dailyAffirmation177": "You don't have to win the day. Surviving it with snacks is a legitimate strategy.",
  "dailyAffirmation178": "Some days you're a lion. Some days you're a lion who just wants a blanket. Both are valid.",
  "dailyAffirmation179": "You are allowed to laugh at the chaos. It's usually the sanest response.",
  "dailyAffirmation180": "Your future self will thank you for that nap you're about to take.",
  "dailyAffirmation181": "You are worthy of love that doesn't ask you to change first.",
  "dailyAffirmation182": "You are worthy of rest, even on days you haven't \"earned\" it.",
  "dailyAffirmation183": "You are worthy of taking up space exactly as you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation184": "You are worthy of being chosen, not just tolerated.",
  "dailyAffirmation185": "You are worthy of kindness, including your own.",
  "dailyAffirmation186": "You are worthy of good things, even the ones you haven't asked for.",
  "dailyAffirmation187": "You are worthy of people who show up for you.",
  "dailyAffirmation188": "You are worthy of a life that feels like yours.",
  "dailyAffirmation189": "You are worthy of being believed when you speak.",
  "dailyAffirmation190": "You are worthy of softness, even in a hard world.",
  "dailyAffirmation191": "You are worthy of joy that has no explanation attached.",
  "dailyAffirmation192": "You are worthy of safety, wherever you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation193": "You are worthy of being loved without earning it first.",
  "dailyAffirmation194": "You are worthy of a seat at the table, not just a spot in the room.",
  "dailyAffirmation195": "You are worthy of dreams that are yours, not borrowed from anyone else.",
  "dailyAffirmation196": "You are worthy of patience, especially your own.",
  "dailyAffirmation197": "You are worthy of being understood, not just tolerated.",
  "dailyAffirmation198": "You are worthy of good things happening to you, not just surviving.",
  "dailyAffirmation199": "You are worthy of being celebrated, not just accepted.",
  "dailyAffirmation200": "You are worthy exactly as you are today, unfinished and all.",
  "dailyAffirmation201": "You are worthy of a future that doesn't repeat your hardest days.",
  "dailyAffirmation202": "You are worthy of feeling proud of yourself, without conditions attached.",
  "dailyAffirmation203": "You are worthy of people who don't make you shrink.",
  "dailyAffirmation204": "You are worthy of your own respect, first and always.",
  "dailyAffirmation205": "You are worthy of gentleness on the days you feel least deserving of it.",
  "dailyAffirmation206": "You are worthy of being someone's favorite person.",
  "dailyAffirmation207": "You are worthy of a life with more ease in it.",
  "dailyAffirmation208": "You are worthy, not because of what you do, but because you exist.",
  "dailyAffirmation209": "You are worthy of being wanted, not just needed.",
  "dailyAffirmation210": "You are worthy of trusting yourself again.",
